1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:03,720
Why do your auditors write to your bank, not to you?

2
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:06,200
Why are the auditors writing to our bank?

3
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:11,162
It's a bank confirmation. The bank confirms balances directly.

4
00:00:11,282 --> 00:00:13,085
Can't we just send our statements?

5
00:00:13,205 --> 00:00:17,619
Usually not. Evidence straight from the bank carries more weight.

6
00:00:17,739 --> 00:00:20,533
Sign the bank's consent early.

7
00:00:20,653 --> 00:00:23,947
List every account and loan.

8
00:00:24,067 --> 00:00:27,189
Reconcile each balance.

9
00:00:27,309 --> 00:00:31,328
Our audit & risk advisory helps you prepare.

10
00:00:31,448 --> 00:00:36,629
Auditors' letters going out? Send us a WhatsApp.
